      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Turn on airplane mode\nAsk Siri.Say something like: “Turn on airplane mode.”\n• Put both your AppleWatch and iPhone in airplane mode in one step: Open the\nAppleWatch app on your iPhone, tap My Watch, go to General> Airplane Mode, then turn on Mirror iPhone. When your iPhone and AppleWatch are within normal Bluetooth range of each other (about 33 feet or 10 meters), any time you switch to airplane mode on one device, the other switches to match.",
